  "body": "https://mimesniff.spec.whatwg.org/#supplied-mime-type says it holds a [MIME type](https://mimesniff.spec.whatwg.org/#mime-type), but the [supplied MIME type detection algorithm](https://mimesniff.spec.whatwg.org/#supplied-mime-type-detection-algorithm) never calls [parse a MIME type from bytes](https://mimesniff.spec.whatwg.org/#parse-a-mime-type-from-bytes) to convert the header's byte sequence value to a mime type.",
